#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "About NXEmu"
msgstr "Acerca de NXEmu"

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "NXEmu is an experimental open-source Nintendo Switch emulator."
msgstr "NXEmu es un emulador experimental de Nintendo Switch de código abierto."

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "You are responsible for ensuring your use of this software complies with the laws in your jurisdiction."
msgstr "Es tu responsabilidad asegurarte de que el uso de este software cumpla las leyes de tu jurisdicción."

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "With thanks to"
msgstr "Agradecimientos a"

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "the yuzu project, Fabrice, Alexwpi, Stardust, and NullVector"
msgstr "el proyecto yuzu, Fabrice, Alexwpi, Stardust y NullVector"

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Sitio web"

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Código fuente"

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "\"Nintendo Switch\" is a trademark of Nintendo. NXEmu is not affiliated with Nintendo in any way."
msgstr "«Nintendo Switch» es una marca comercial de Nintendo. NXEmu no está afiliado a Nintendo de ninguna manera."

#: assets/about_dialog.rml
msgid "OK"
msgstr "Aceptar"

